N        EQU   16
KEY      EQU   1000
INFO     EQU   1100
K        EQU   1200
         ORIG  3000
START    LDA   K           S1. Initialize.
         ENT1  1-N         i ← 1.
2H       CMPA  KEY+N,1     S2. Compare.
         JE    SUCCESS     Exit if K = Ki.
         INC1  1           S3. Advance.
         J1NP  2B          S4. End of file?
FAILURE  EQU   *           Exit if not in table.
         ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  LDA   INFO+N,1
         HLT
         END   START
